          "How checkout works",
          "Checkout"
        ],
        "slice": 0,
        "slices": 1,
        "text": "Checkout builds a Cart, prices it with price_lines, then CartService::apply_discount applies the promotion rules. Discounts are never trusted from the client (see ADR 0007).\n\napply_discount verifies totals on the server. The architecture is the identifier reference for checkout."
      },
